## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Plus
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.5 Plus is described in local metadata as a hosted vision-language model for agents and coding with 1M context, now superseded by newer Qwen 3.6+ tiers.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Qwen hosted surfaces (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.5-plus` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.5-plus`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total (991,808 in / 65,536 out) per local metadata.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Tiered/pricing ranges listed in local metadata (e.g. ~$0.26–$0.40/$1.56–$2.40 per 1M, regional/provider variants); not independently verified from accessible official pricing pages in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Hosted vision-language model per local metadata; architecture details not independently verified in this pass.

